      "sourceTextSha256": "2f46ab26c6f01b8deecd5ccaf0bfca35f319e7a5ac091753d13ed30184999407",
      "text": "If you have children, they have probably seen the animated films “Rio” and “Rio 2”. On this trip, you and your children will discover many of the places shown in the films: colourful Rio de Janeiro, framed by the deep green of the Atlantic rainforest; the Iguazu Falls, one of the most spectacular collections of waterfalls on Earth; the Amazon rainforest, the largest tropical forest in the world; and finally Búzios, the jewel of the Rio coastline, to relax by the beach with your family.",
